Data
----
The underlying research data (paired-end 16S rRNA and ITS amplicon sequencing
reads from a hydroponics microbiome experiment) belongs to a research project
conducted at Newcastle University. This repository includes 4 example FASTQ
files (2 forward/reverse pairs, one 16S and one ITS) out of the several
thousand files that made up the full ~20 GB raw sequencing dataset. The full
raw dataset is not published in this repository. These example files, and
the processed/summarized outputs derived from the full dataset, are shared
here solely to illustrate the analysis for portfolio purposes.

DADA2 pipeline attribution
---------------------------
The DADA2 methodology used in this repository's workflow scripts is not the
repository owner's original work. DADA2 was developed by Benjamin Callahan
and colleagues. See https://benjjneb.github.io/dada2/ for the original
software, documentation, and license. This repository contains only the
owner's application of that published pipeline to their own dissertation
data, plus their own downstream statistical analysis and visualization code.

